  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#000\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PcXKgc6.png\" alt=\"尤里卡！\" width=\"808\" height=\"287\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvalkyrienskies.org%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方網站</a> | <a href=\"https://discord.gg/dWwM8G3\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> | <a href=\"https://github.com/ValkyrienSkies/Eureka\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eureka-ships/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:7499\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric 版下載</a> | </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eureka-ships/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689:7498\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">Forge 版下載</span></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000\">用普通的（或模組的！）Minecraft 方塊建造並設計專屬於你的船艦，放置船舵，按住 Shift 並右鍵、組合，然後看著你的作品突然注入物理效果。你的 Minecraft 建築將不再永遠靜止佇立於同一處。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000;font-weight:bold\">注意：雖然 Valkyrien Skies 是一個真實物理引擎，但 Eureka 船艦並不具備真實物理效果。為了方便玩家更容易建造船艦，所有船舵都會施加穩定力/力矩。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Eureka 是 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/valkyrien-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Valkyrien Skies</em></a> 的一個簡單擴充模組，符合原版風格，使用起來既簡單又有趣。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">用普通的（或模組的！）Minecraft 方塊建造並設計專屬於你的船艦，放置船舵，按住 Shift 並右鍵、組合，然後看著你的作品突然注入物理效果。你的 Minecraft 建築將不再永遠靜止佇立於同一處。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DaxvXa9.png\" alt=\"Eureka 方塊\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1057\"><br></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LuYnqaVUuQA\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/o0Bf9gBGJwA?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">依賴模組</span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/valkyrien-skies\" rel=\"nofollow\">Valkyrien Skies</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API（僅 1.16 版）</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API（僅 1.16 版）</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kotlin-for-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kotlin For Forge（僅 Forge 使用者）</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API（僅 Fabric 使用者）</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-language-kotlin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric Language Kotlin（僅 1.16 Fabric 使用者）</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#000\">- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu（僅 Fabric 使用者）</a></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">材質包</span></strong></span></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/eureka-create-airships\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#000\">尤里卡！創造飛船！</span></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/393061443492118541/1063247181718499359/helms.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"278\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fvalkyrien-skies-eureka-re-texture%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">尤里卡！重新材質</a></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img style=\"width:757px;margin-left:4px\" src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/texture-pack/2023/499/16454249_l.webp\" alt=\"\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>*Eureka 是完全從頭開始構建的，並非基於如 Archimedes Ships 等舊版飛船模組的程式碼。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
